"package keto\n\n// Declare each namespace as a field of `namespaces`. A namespace can declare\n// relations and permissions. A permission is a subject-set rewrite.\n//\n// Examples:\n//\n//\tFile: {\n//\t\trelations: {\n//\t\t\tparents: types: [\"File\", \"Folder\"]\n//\t\t\tviewers: types: [\"User\", \"Group#members\"]\n//\t\t}\n//\t\tpermissions: view: {\n//\t\t\top: \"or\"\n//\t\t\tchildren: [\n//\t\t\t\t{op: \"direct\", relation: \"viewers\"},\n//\t\t\t\t{op: \"tupleToSubjectSet\", tupleSetRelation: \"parents\", computedSubjectSet: \"view\"},\n//\t\t\t]\n//\t\t}\n//\t}\nnamespaces: {\n}\n"
